OL,3,GNEWSA'Beloved cats need more protection
OL,4,Afrom drivers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeloved cats need more protection to
OL,7,Fstop them dying on the road after being
OL,8,Fhit by a driver, campaigners claim.
OL,10,FLegally, motorists have to report when
OL,11,Fthey hit a dog or cattle, but not cats.
OL,12,FA petition calling on ministers to
OL,13,Fupdate the rules has received more than
OL,14,F189,000 signatures and will be debated
OL,15,Fin Parliament later.
OL,17,FGinny Parratt, who runs the cat rescue
OL,18,FCats in Distress in Somerset, said a
OL,19,Fdriver stopping and checking on the
OL,20,Fanimal could be the difference between
OL,21,Flife and death.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
