OL,3,GNEWSA'Beloved cats need more protection
OL,4,Afrom drivers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said there
OL,7,Fare no current plans to make drivers
OL,8,Freport collisions with cats. But its
OL,9,FRoad Safety Strategy will improve
OL,10,Fsafety for all road users, including
OL,11,Fcats.
